          "quote": "ECG performed in office; rhythm strip reviewed.",
          "explanation": "When a complete 12-lead ECG (93000) is performed in the office, the rhythm strip review is generally considered a component of the complete tracing and interpretation. Separate billing of 93040 in addition to 93000 for the same encounter appears duplicative and may conflict with NCCI bundling guidance unless the rhythm strip was performed as a distinctly separate, separately identifiable service (e.g., a telemetry event strip at a different time)."
